   "Qualifying Commercial Entity" means any individual, company, or
   organization (including all Affiliates, parent companies, and
   subsidiaries, evaluated collectively) that meets ANY of the following
   criteria:
   (a) has annual gross revenue exceeding five million U.S. dollars
       ($5,000,000 USD), calculated across the entity and all Affiliates;
   (b) has received more than ten million U.S. dollars ($10,000,000 USD)
       in cumulative funding (including venture capital, private equity,
       grants, government funding, or other investment), calculated
       across the entity and all Affiliates;
   (c) has more than one hundred (100) employees, contractors, or
       equivalent full-time personnel, calculated across the entity
       and all Affiliates;
   (d) has more than one million (1,000,000) monthly active users
       across all products and services.

   "Derivative Work" means any work that is based on, derived from,
